HST Office: the File page (backstage) covers the ribbon and the document, left of the banner.

1.0.2 ribbon (gap list G13): the File panel dropped down under the ribbon at about 780 x 580 px. It now drops
down from the bottom of the tab row and covers the ribbon body and the document area down to the window's
bottom, as the reference suite's File page does, but stops left of the HASON TECH banner, which stays visible
(owner decision 14/11/2026, docs/BANNERS.md). Without a ribbon it covers the document area as before. Only
BackstageWindow::GetPlacement changes; the pages themselves are untouched.

